%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a53ee3976b5135c4e9247ce665451ab3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Gameplay2Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: What... happened to me?
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Where am I? Is this my final end?
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: ...
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: "Maybe I already know why I\u2019m here."
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: I'm just a hollow shell... someone who hid behind a mask for so long,
        I forgot who I was.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: What was the point of pushing myself every single day... like that
        beetle rolling its ball? It always tumbles back down, no matter how hard
        I try.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Or like that horse... forced to run endlessly, doing things it never
        wanted to do.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: It all feels so meaningless. I can't even express how I truly feel
        anymore. Even the cookie gets crushed... just because it didn't fit the mold.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: ...
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Echo
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Find them...
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Wh-who's there? Who said that?!
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Its the same voice
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Echo
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Find them... before it all disappears.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Wait! 'Find them'? What is that supposed to mean...?
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: ...
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: I guess lying here won't change anything. Maybe I should explore
        this place...
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Nara
      background: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Maybe I can find them in every corner.
      onLeft: 0
    changeScene: 0
    sceneName: 
